&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Bring a deep understanding of branding, culture, and contemporary design — creating work that resonates with today’s most ambitious brands and founders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Take ownership of your role and growth — embracing feedback, refining your craft, and setting a high bar for creative excellence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Enhance the overall Roblox brand by creating compelling, crafted design materials about our brand&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Contribute to how Roblox is defined and understood across all marketing surfaces&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with cross-functional partners across the organization to execute on-brand marketing materials&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain and contribute to our brand identity to ensure design consistency and craft&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Work together with a collaborative team to deliver engaging visual designs that achieve business objectives while mentoring and provide feedback to other designers, elevating craft and cohesion across the team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You Have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You have at least 7+ years of design experience with an exceptional portfolio that demonstrates strong conceptual thinking mixed with meticulous design execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Your experience comes from the agency side and/or brand side. You have experience with vendors (e.g., agencies and production partners) and are comfortable guiding an agency as you are crafting and are happy to move between those roles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;High fluency in software, including Figma, Adobe Creative Suite (Illustrator, Photoshop), Google Slides, and Keynote.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;An obsession with craft: You place a high value on crafting your work, focusing on quality over quantity of ideas produced. You recognize that being detail-oriented is a badge of honor, and that going the extra mile to produce top-tier quality work that’s visually pleasing and engaging even on tight timelines is essential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A thoughtful and resilient mindset. You understand that design is iterative and have the ability to operate nimbly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The ability to be a self starter: You are comfortable and able to work independently, managing timelines and briefs from multiple projects and partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ブランドデザイナー、APAC&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox（ロブロックス）には、毎日何千万ものユーザーがアクセスし、私たちの世界規模の開発者/クリエーターコミュニティが創造した没入型の3Dデジタル空間で探検し、制作し、プレイし、学び、そして友人とつながっています。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robloxは、彼らの想像力が生むどんなバーチャル空間にも、生命を吹き込むことを可能にするツールとプラットフォームを、コミュニティのために構築しています。当社のビジョンは、世界のどこでも、どのデバイスからも、人々がつながる新しい方法を創造することです。当社の使命は、10億人の人々を希望と思いやりでつなぐことです。当社では現在、その実現をお手伝いしてくれる優れた人材を募集しています。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robloxでのキャリアは、人と人とのつながりの未来を形づくり、例のない大規模な技術課題を解決し、誰にでもより安全で思いやりのある共有されたバーチャル空間のために働くことを意味します。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robloxで募集中の職種は、APAC全域のグロースマーケティングのサポートを担当する、東京のオンサイト勤務のブランドデザイナーです。このポジションは、大規模かつ高品質で考え抜かれたデザインを提供することに注力する実践的な役割です。このデザイナー職は、マーケッター、チームや代理店、ビジネスパートナーと密に連携し、ブリーフィングを戦略に沿った創造性に富むものに具体化し、地域マーケティングでRobloxを表現していく仕事です。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;役割としては、社内チームや社外代理店へのブリーフィング、指導的なフィードバック、最終的なマーケティングアセットの納品まで、コンセプトから制作までのデザインプロセス全体の管理が求められます。業務の主要部分は、複数のアスペクト比や日本や韓国市場など向けの多言語化を含め、毎月6つ以上のコンセプトを目標に、一定量のクリエイティブを制作していただくことです。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;この職務は制作だけでなく、各アセットが多様なAPAC地域のターゲットにとって文化的になじみ、かつ適切で効果的であるように確認し、手直しする責任もあります。細部への配慮、協調性、仕上がりに妥協することなく手早く業務を遂行する能力が、成功の鍵となります。母国語レベルでの日本語会話と読み書きは必須、韓国語の会話と読み書き能力もある方は歓迎します。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;求められる条件：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;デザインと創造への熱意があり、業務の枠を超えられる方。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;トレンドを追うよりも、新しいものを生み出したい方。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;経験豊富なデザイナーで、常にアイデアを形にし、独自のアイデンティティを作り出し、同僚にインスピレーションを与えて業務の質を向上させる方。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;概念的思考力とシステム思考力、グラフィックデザイン、ビジュアルデザイン、タイポグラフィ、アイデンティティデザインの高レベルのスキルセットがある方。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ワークストリームを主導でき、ステークホルダーへの対応とコミュニケーションの経験がある方。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;担当業務：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;アセットを、多様なAPAC地域のターゲットに文化的になじみのある、適切で効果的なものになるよう、確認し手直しすること。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;チームと緊密に連携し、デザイナーの指導、アイデアの共有、オープンな姿勢と専門技能で業務の質を向上させること。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;デザインワークの具体化とプレゼンを主導し、クライアントやステークホルダーにコンセプトを明確に確信を持って伝えること。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;インサイトと戦略を、ブランド促進に役立つ、良く練られた表現豊かなデザインシステムとアイデンティティに昇華させること。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ブランディング、文化、現代デザインに関する深い理解を、現代の最も野心的なブランドと創業者が共感できるクリエイティブワークにつなげること。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;自分の役割と成長に責任を持って、フィードバックを活用し、技能を磨き、クリエイティブに卓越性の高いハードルを設定すること。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;当社ブランドに関する訴求力がある丹念なデザイン素材を作成し、全般的なRobloxブランドを強化すること。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;すべてのマーケティング上の露出における、Robloxの定義のされ方と理解のされ方に寄与すること。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;当社の部門横断的なパートナーと連携し、ブランドイメージに合うマーケティング資料を作成すること。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;デザインの一貫性と専門性を確保することで、当社のブランドアイデンティティを維持し、それに寄与すること。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;コラボレーションチームと協力してビジネス目標を達成する魅力的なビジュアルデザインを提供しながら、デザイナーを指導し、フィードバックを与え、チーム全体の技能と結束を高めること。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;求められる経験：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7年以上のデザイン経験と、高レベルの概念的思考と綿密なデザイン化を兼ね備えた優れたポートフォリオを有すること。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;代理店および/またはブランドの立場で経験があること。業者（代理店やプロダクションなど）相手の経験があり、制作面で代理店に指示することに抵抗がなく、どちら側の立場にも立てること。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Figma、Adobe Creative Suite（イラストレーター、フォトショップ）、Google スライド、Keynote等を含むソフトウェアに精通していること。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;職人技へのこだわり：アイデアの量よりも質を重視し、作品の仕上がりに高い価値を置いていること。細部へのこだわりに誇りを持ち、心地良いビジュアルで惹き付ける最高の仕上がりのために、厳しいスケジュールの中で最後まで粘ることの重要性を認識していること。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;機転が利き、適応性がある心構えであること。デザインはイテレーション（練り上げるもの）であることを理解し、それを手際よく行えること。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;セルフスターター（自主性）能力：複数のプロジェクトやパートナーのタイムラインやブリーフをやり繰りしながら、自律的に動くことに慣れ、その能力もあること。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;オフィス勤務は火・水・木曜日にオンサイトで、月曜日と金曜日は任意で出勤（特に指示がない場合）。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robloxは、すべての従業員と応募者に平等な雇用機会を提供し、人種、肌の色、宗教、年齢、性別、出身国、障害度、遺伝子、保護対象の退役軍人の地位、性的指向、性自認または性別表現、その他の連邦法、州法、現地方で保護されている属性に関わらず、あらゆる種類の差別およびハラスメントを禁止しています。またRobloxは採用選考で、適格障害者や対象となる宗教的信条の応募者に対して合理的配慮を提供しています。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;米国を拠点とする職務に限り、当社は、特定の米国ビザカテゴリに関連する米国就労許可を持つ応募者をこの職務に雇用できない場合があること、また、現時点では将来的なH-1Bスポンサーシップをサポートできない場合があることにご注意ください。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The&lt;strong&gt; Engine Networking Team &lt;/strong&gt;pulls the players together by ensuring the communication of the game state to all. As a Senior Network Transport Engineer you will help the players experience the game as a nearly synchronous world. Just as the nerves in our bodies coordinate our actions, the network system coordinates all the computers involved into a smooth experience for the players. You will work in all areas of the game platform in your quest for real-time communication of every part of Roblox.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Worked on a powerful user-space network stack, solving problems related to scale, performance, latency, and throughput in client/server environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Worked on a very large multithreaded distributed system that connects millions of users worldwide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Worked on all the devices Roblox supports - from desktop clients to mobile phone clients to console clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Worked on a game engine and understand how a game engine works&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A software engineer with 4+ years of experience with Game networking coming from a Game Engine/Studio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep understanding of Network Stack with a passion for working with open source&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong systems-level C++ programming experience and fascinated by the actual work the CPU does when you use smart pointers, templates, virtual functions, and blocks of memory, both structured and raw&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Linux networking and have a good understanding of common network protocols&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keen to each millisecond of the network exchanges: You know where the time goes and how to reduce the waste&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of what happens on the operating systems level when certain code is completed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$195,780&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$242,100 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Roblox, we believe that careers are dynamic and should be a continuous progression through challenges and opportunities that build new skills and strengths.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our commitment to fostering growth and development, we encourage you to learn more about this opportunity and apply if you see a potential fit!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Counsel for the Americas on the Regulatory &amp;amp; International Legal team, you will advise business and legal teams on existing and emerging online safety, AI, and consumer laws in the Americas, and support regulatory engagement activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role reports to the Head of Americas, Regulatory &amp;amp; International Legal. The ideal candidate will be proactive, a quick learner, and comfortable with complex and evolving legal requirements. This is an opportunity to join a growing legal team, learn about exciting new technologies and business models, and work on novel legal issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and advise on existing, pending, and developing regulations in the Americas, with a focus on online safety, AI, and consumer laws;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement compliance strategies;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and educate colleagues on new legislative and regulatory trends affecting Roblox in region;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to requests for advice from cross-functional teams as needed; and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support regulatory engagement activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-7 years of relevant legal experience;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;License to practice law in a US jurisdiction;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with or for a company or companies in the social media, content or gaming space;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience tracking and analyzing state and federal legislative proposals;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience dealing with online safety, consumer or other relevant regulators;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of, or interest in, regulatory landscape in the Americas (including but not limited to the US);&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong critical judgment and analytical skills with the ability to propose solutions and translate your legal analysis into practical advice, taking into account the needs and objectives of the business;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organizational and prioritization skills;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to work independently and effectively in a remote environment;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to handle a diverse and complex workload; and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to work collaboratively within a small, tightly-knit team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$211,760&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$252,210 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roblox’s Safety Operations team is dedicated to protecting our users from individuals who want to harm others. The Critical Harms Intelligence, Investigations, and Operations (CHIIOPS) team applies subject matter expertise to our highest-level risks, and works with cross-functional partners to identify and mitigate these actors. As part of our commitment to safety, we are looking for a specialist with an investigator’s mindset, skills, and curiosity to investigate and respond to some of our highest-risk escalations. You will work with teams and leaders across the company to quickly and professionally respond to urgent requests for support, and balance competing priorities to get the job done. You will share findings with intel analysts to support behavioral analysis development to help identify risks across the platform. You will report to the Critical Harms, Intelligence, Investigations, and Operations Senior Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please Note: This role may review graphic, controversial, and sometimes offensive content in line with Roblox’s content moderation practices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Incident Investigation and Triage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, own, and drive rapid investigations into critical and complex incidents, including but not limited to threats against child safety, violent extremism, and other high-severity harms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize internal tools, data analysis, and open-source intelligence (OSINT) techniques to gather evidence, establish facts, and determine the root cause of incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the subject matter expert and primary point of contact for all critical incidents, independently managing communication with executive leadership and cross-functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all investigations are documented thoroughly, accurately, and completed in a timely manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Emergency Response and Coordination&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate within a 24/7 on-call rotation to respond immediately to high-risk and/or time-sensitive incidents that pose significant risk to users, the platform, or the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and direct incident response efforts, orchestrating cross-functional teams to ensure a unified and effective investigation and remediation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategically draft and deliver real-time, high-stakes communications and strategic recommendations to executive leadership regarding incident status, impact assessment, and mitigation efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect, own, and continuously iterate on robust incident response playbooks and protocols for various critical harms scenarios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive detailed post-mortem reviews (Root Cause Analysis), identifying and implementing structural improvements to policy, process, and technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor&#39;s Degree is required, or, in lieu of a degree, a minimum of 5 years of relevant experience in investigations, incident management, and/or policy enforcement on a social platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience (5+ years) managing high-pressure, sensitive, and complex investigations with significant independence and minimal supervision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to articulate complex technical and sensitive issues clearly to executive audiences and non-technical partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to use data analysis, internal dashboards, and investigation tools to support fact-finding.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring junior investigators and guiding complex casework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with online safety issues to include exposure to high-severity risk content is preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills, strong prioritization acumen, and the ability to build processes from the ground up.&lt;/li&gt;
