&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Facilities Engineer will be a self-motivated, task-oriented individual who leads all aspects of the Cafe Infrastructure, while attending to daily Facility needs. You will be assisting the Facilities Team with various programs, web pages, and special projects. We are looking for a fast-paced individual with a strong sense of urgency and a hands-on approach to daily operations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced with 10+ years Facilities/Cafe Operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can be productive and effective with minimal direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert at building relationships with customers and enjoy customer service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledgable with technology in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resourceful, exhibit patience under pressure, and are capable of finding solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong communicator and self-starter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Well organized and detail oriented with excellent multi-tasking ability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on, proactive, and able to respond quickly to operational needs with urgency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable taking ownership of repairs and being the first line of response before escalating to vendors&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in developing a comprehensive Maintenance Program for Cafe Equipment Operations&lt;/li&gt;
