&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a visionary Principal Software Engineer to join our Compute organization and provide technical leadership for our Kubernetes infrastructure. You will drive the evolution of a platform that powers our global scale operations, transforming Kubernetes into a secure, reliable, and invisible foundation for our developers across our on-prem and public cloud fleet. Your mission is to balance cutting-edge innovation with rigorous platform stability, ensuring that internal and external customers have a seamless, high-performance experience at massive scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architectural Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as a technical lead for our Kubernetes ecosystem, setting the long-term architectural strategy for a platform that manages thousands of nodes and supports millions of concurrent requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Focus: &lt;/strong&gt;Think deeply about how our internal customers consume and interact with compute, designing intuitive interfaces and tooling that simplify consumption of complex infrastructure services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep-Dive Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage deep expertise in Kubernetes internals, including custom controllers, operators, API server architecture, and etcd, to solve complex scaling bottlenecks and optimize our control plane.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Multi-tenancy:&lt;/strong&gt; Architect robust security, isolation, and identity solutions that allow diverse workloads to safely coexist at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the design of advanced automation, observability, and self-healing systems that minimize MTTR and maintain world-class uptime for our global compute fleet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with engineering leadership to define the technical roadmap, balancing feature velocity against platform integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt; Foster a culture of technical excellence across the Compute organization through rigorous architectural reviews, code standards, and the active mentorship of senior and staff-level engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 10+ years of experience building and operating large-scale distributed systems, platform engineering, or cloud infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated expertise in Kubernetes internals, with a track record of modifying or extending the Kubernetes ecosystem (custom controllers, operators, upstream contributions).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production Scale:&lt;/strong&gt; A history of building and operating mission-critical infrastructure platforms that serve thousands of nodes or high-throughput, low-latency microservices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security &amp;amp; Networking:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of cloud-native security practices, identity solutions, and container networking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record as a technical anchor, with the ability to communicate complex concepts, influence cross-functional stakeholders, and lead initiatives across multiple teams.&lt;/li&gt;
