&lt;li&gt;8+ years of professional industry experience with a proven track record of technical leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional proficiency in C++ and deep expertise in systems-level programming, specifically targeting large-scale environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience with at least one non-desktop platform (e.g. mobile or console).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A commitment to accountability, with experience managing systems where a 0.1% regression is considered a significant and actionable event.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An adaptive mindset, with a strong desire to explore new technologies and move beyond established comfort zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding interpersonal skills, prioritizing team execution and collective success over individual contributions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
