&lt;li&gt;Help build a first-of-its-kind ads system within the Roblox Game Engine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop new ad formats and integrations, starting with video&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the design and performance of systems that scale across all Roblox experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play a foundational role in shaping a multi-billion dollar Ads business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build with an emphasis on user experience, performance, and platform integrity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with cross-functional teams to deliver thoughtful, community-respecting ad solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
